",0]},{"t":"Parece exatamente igual à caixa preta que está na orelha dela, certo?","e":"It looks exactly like the black box on her ear, right?","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.893901,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"410bbc4c4ebba1d7b15deb7c67fd3017","i":"8d91a5032a4c0e8bce9fc20fe905beec","r":"3967856:7025269:564:4367215","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["3967856","7025269","564"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"A Maria estava a usar uma camisola preta quando me encontrei com ela.","e":"Mary was wearing a black sweater when I met her.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.853603,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"422f107a6a86e1493ec2c1eec4f435bd","i":"bc47649b8a8358cd3d44e74f42615391","r":"1018468:32036","c":"Fermoselle","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1018468","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1018468","b":"Tatoeba sentence #1018468 by Fermoselle; English translation #32036 by CK","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1018468","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Mal os meus pais descubram a varinha, vou atrás da Fada Preta.","e":"Once my folks find that wand, I'm gonna go after the Black Fairy.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.756744,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"cfe7fa7fef8ffb0e914367ce542e557c","i":"05ec0c37df1d3c413381f60ed72a8a19","r":"6502530:6970616:136:5149948","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6502530","6970616","136"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Você escreve de caneta azul ou de caneta preta?","e":"Do you write with a blue or a black pen?","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.910887,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"7a8fc40472728e0d0dc6f3a6da377cc1","i":"5f065d8d5d70de7b034883dc0220a382","r":"1017867:9934909","c":"alexmarcelo","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1017867","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1017867","b":"Tatoeba sentence #1017867